eir loyalty quests.\u00a0Give them gifts to boost or lower their affection level. \u00a0\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Romance</strong> \u2013 Choose one of three love interests: A sulky Sheriff, a blunt Storm Sailor, and an alien Librarian. Win\u00a0their hearts, lead them away from destructive paths, and beware of their jealousy.\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inspect, Interview, Investigate</strong> - Use a point-and-click elements to inspect various locations and gather items. Interview characters to gain valuable information and investigate mysteries to reach a good or bad conclusion.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 65 backgrounds</strong> - Including 30 explorable locations that you can visit, as well as over\u00a060\u00a0CGs.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape your character</strong> - Choose your pronouns and pick one of six hobbies. Each hobby matches one of your companion's interests and unlocks extra scenes.\u00a0<br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trailer music: Confronting The Man In Black - Harvey Carman (CC BY 4.0)<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul>","developers":["Bucket Hat Cat"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250420/4986003c4b7c39c9cc7e9ed30cd88fe6b9d0782e/header.jpg?t=1772645453","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2024 Bucket Hat Cat. Wszelkie prawa zastrze\u017cone.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Version: 10.10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 Ghz 64-bit Intel-compatible<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.0</li></ul>"},"movi